SUMMARY:🍂 Crothers Woods Fall Hike & Ice Cream Treat! 🍦
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n## 🍂
  **Crothers Woods Fall Hike & Ice Cream Treat!** 🍦\n\nToronto doesn’t
  have many true hiking trails — but Crothers Woods is one of the best! T
 his beautiful wooded trail is especially stunning in the fall\, with the l
 eaves turning every shade of red and gold.\nWe’ll start by walking along
  **Broadview Avenue to Pottery Road**\, heading down the hill to meet the 
 **Don Valley Trail**. From there\, we’ll join the **Crothers Woods Trail
 **\, take in the fall colours\, stop for a short break\, and then walk bac
 k.\n\nThere are a few light hills — and one big one at the very end (Pot
 tery Road\, I’m looking at you!) — but don’t worry\, there’s a swe
 et reward waiting. After all that hard work\, we’ll stop for **Dairy Que
 en ice cream**!\nThis hike is a bit more challenging than some of our regu
 lar walks\, but totally worth it for the views (and the ice cream).\n\n**T
 his event happens rain or shine!**\n\n***\n\n### 📍 **Meetup Details**\n
 \n**Meeting Spot:** Right outside **Broadview Subway Station** — I’ll 
 be the one wearing the **Moose Hat!** 🦌\n**Ending Spot:** Broadview Sub
 way Station\n**Meetup Fee:** $5 (cash in person or e-transfer to **mathewm
 aclean@hotmail.com**)\n\n***\n\n### 🕒 **Timing**\n\n11:00am and I will 
 only wait 5mins — the hike should take about **2 hours**.\nYou can leave
  anytime you like if you need to head back early.\n\n***\n\n### 🥾 **Wha
 t to Bring**\n\n* Water\n* Good walking or hiking shoes\n* A snack\n* A po
 sitive attitude (and maybe room for ice cream!)\n\n***\n\n### ⚠️ **A Q
 uick Note**\n\nSometimes things come up and I might need to cancel or resc
 hedule. Please keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\n***\n\n### 
 👋 **About This Group**\n\nThis group is open to **everyone** — whethe
 r you’re single or not\, new to the city\, or just looking to be social 
 and make friends.\nWe also host **movies\, walks\, hikes\, arts & culture 
 events\, and restaurant outings**!\nYou can RSVP ahead of time **or just s
 how up** if you’re not sure you can make it — we’re flexible like th
 at.\n\n***\n\n**Organizer:** Mathew\n📧 Email: **torontomoviesandoutings
 @hotmail.com**
