SUMMARY:# 🧠 Trivia Night at Blue Horse Eatery! 🍻
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🧠 
 Trivia Night at Blue Horse Eatery! 🍻\n\nReady to put your knowledge to 
 the test? Join us for a fun evening of trivia\, good food\, drinks\, and g
 reat company at **Blue Horse Eatery!**\n\nOur trivia night is hosted by Co
 lleen. **TONY KROLO** is the quizmaster. Whether you're a trivia pro or ju
 st coming out for a fun night with new people\, everyone is welcome!\n\n
 📅 **Date:** Wednesday\, October 14\, 2026\n🕖 **Trivia starts at 7:00
  PM**\n📍 **Location:** Blue Horse Eatery\n👋 **Host:** Colleen\n\n###
  📍 When You Arrive\n\nWhen you arrive\, **ask the host for Colleen's ta
 ble** so you can find our group.\n\n### 💳 Important Information for Fir
 st-Timers\n\nIf this is your first time attending colleen's trivia\, **you
  must send an e-transfer to lock in your spot.** send $5 to tommills@roger
 s.com\, and notify colleen RIGHT AWAY\, on this page or by personal msg. y
 ou'll be refunded if/when you show up. (send a $10 refundable deposit for 
 a guest).\n\n### 🍔 Support Our Venue\n\nPlease plan to spend a **minimu
 m of $10 per person** on food and/or drinks. (plus tax and tip) Supporting
  the venue helps ensure we can continue enjoying fun events like this toge
 ther!\n\n### 🎉 Come Join the Fun!\n\nBring your brainpower\, your sense
  of humour\, and your appetite for a great night out. You don't need to kn
 ow everything — just come ready to have fun!\n\n**Great trivia. Good foo
 d. Even better company!** 🐴
