SUMMARY:🍁 Fall Walk: Glen Stewart Ravine & Beach Boardwalk Adventure! 
 🍦🌊
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n## 🍁
  **Fall Walk: Glen Stewart Ravine & Beach Boardwalk Adventure!** 🍦🌊\
 n\nJoin us for a **beautiful fall walk** through one of Toronto’s most s
 cenic spots — the **Glen Stewart Ravine** — followed by a stroll along
  the **Beach Boardwalk**!\n\nWe’ll take in the crisp autumn air\, the co
 lourful leaves\, and the sound of the waves — plus a treat (or two) alon
 g the way.\n\nOur walk begins at **Main Subway Station**\, where we’ll m
 ake our way down **Main Street**\, head east along **Kingston Road**\, and
  then wander through the **Glen Stewart Ravine** — one of Toronto’s be
 st hidden gems.\nAfter exploring the ravine\, we’ll stop for a well-dese
 rved treat at **Ed’s Real Scoop**\, home to some of the *best ice cream 
 in the city*! 🍨\nIf you’re not in an ice cream mood\, no worries — 
 there’s a cozy coffee shop right across the street. ☕\n\nFrom there\, 
 we’ll head down to the **Boardwalk**\, walk along the lake\, loop around
  **Ashbridges Bay** and finish our adventure at **Woodbine Beach**\, takin
 g in those gorgeous fall views of the water.\n\nThis is the perfect way to
  soak up the fall season before winter sneaks in! 🍂\n\n**A Special Gues
 t Joining Us!**\n\nWe're excited to welcome Miles Howard\, visiting us fro
 m Boston on November 14–15!\n\nMiles is writing *HIKE EVERY CITY*\, a bo
 ok (coming in 2028) exploring urban hiking\, community\, and how exploring
  cities on foot brings people together. He also runs a similar urban hikin
 g project in Boston called *Walking City Trails*.\n\nHe'll be joining us f
 or both weekend outings\, including this walk\, to experience our group fi
 rsthand and meet our members.\n\nFeel free to say hello\, share your exper
 iences\, and chat with Miles if you'd like. No pressure\, of course!\n\nIt
 's exciting to see our community getting noticed beyond Toronto. Let's giv
 e Miles a warm welcome!\n\n***\n\n###\n\n***\n\n### 📍 **Meetup Details*
 *\n\n**Meeting Spot:** Outside **Main Subway Station** — I’ll be waiti
 ng and easy to spot in my **Moose Hat!** 🦌\n**Meeting Time:** **11:30 A
 .M.** (I’ll wait about 5 minutes before we head out.)\n**Ending Spot:** 
 **Woodbine Beach**\n\n***\n\n### 💲 **Meetup Fee**\n\n$5 (cash 💵 or e
 -transfer 📲 to **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**)\nYou can send it before o
 r the day of the event!\n\n***\n\n### 🥾 **What to Bring**\n\n* Water\n*
  Comfortable walking shoes\n* A snack or a few bucks for ice cream ☺️\
 n* A cozy sweater — it might get breezy by the water!\n\n###\n\n***\n\n#
 ## ⚠️ **A Quick Note**\n\nSometimes things come up and I might need to
  cancel or reschedule. Please keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n
 \n***\n\n### 👋 **About This Group**\n\nThis group is open to **everyone
 ** — whether you’re single or not\, new to Toronto\, or just looking t
 o be social and make friends!\nWe also host **movies\, hikes\, arts & cult
 ure events\, and restaurant outings.**\nYou can RSVP ahead of time — or 
 just show up the day of if you’re feeling spontaneous!\n\n***\n\n**Organ
 izer:** Mathew\n📧 **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**Come for
  the fall colours.**\n**Stay for the friendship.** 🍁💛
